    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component 1
1. Availability of Monitoring and Evaluation plan to track OGP commitments 
2. Availability of OGP Stakeholders map
3. Provision of data management analysis and recommendations to the Government
4. Availability of Interior design of the Citizen Reception Center in the Government building
5. Availability of content of the citizen satisfaction dashboard
6. Availability of gender disaggregated criteria for data collection
7. Discussion of partnership opportunities for technical support of citizen satisfaction dashboard
8. Availability of communication plan for all national OGP commitments
9. Availability of technical document for citizen-driven FAQ mechanism

Component 2
1. Procurement of ARVs</narrative>
